<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8"/>
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"/>
  <title>Hors ligne — StumbUpon.com</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/style.css"/>
  <style>
    .offline-page {
      min-height: 100vh;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 2rem;
      gap: 1rem;
    }
    .offline-icon { font-size: 4rem; }
    .offline-title { font-size: 1.5rem; font-weight: 800; color: var(--color-text); }
    .offline-desc  { color: var(--color-text-muted); max-width: 380px; line-height: 1.6; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="offline-page">
    <span class="offline-icon">📡</span>
    <h1 class="offline-title">Tu es hors ligne</h1>
    <p class="offline-desc">
      Pas de réseau disponible pour le moment. Reconnecte-toi et réessaie.
    </p>
    <a href="/" class="btn btn-primary" onclick="location.reload()">Réessayer</a>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
